    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/87f52f7c81365bc2779144890e9ab158.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The killer is here, and now he's coming for you!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will put you through trials, play with your emotions, your mind, and your body. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.poster.avif?t=1749567164\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.webm?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.mp4?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/963c1b507f270c950bbf3bff5fad4ab4.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember those horror movies where you yelled at the protagonist to scream, run, and call the police? Well\u2026 Now it's your turn to be the protagonist. Test your endurance, your mind, and your feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/04dda24554acb7561e074639607eb949.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story through its endings\u2014why did the killer come for you? Why are you strapped to that chair? And why a saw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, a short story\u2014but just enough to keep you entertained for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.poster.avif?t=1749567164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.webm?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.mp4?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/09df55f1ddadd5560b6fd5f2b8d01214.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game that\u2019s also a clicker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique events as you fight to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished, carefully crafted graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not too many puzzles, but just the right amount.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.poster.avif?t=1749567164\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.webm?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.mp4?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/87f52f7c81365bc2779144890e9ab158.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The killer is here, and now he's coming for you!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will put you through trials, play with your emotions, your mind, and your body. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.poster.avif?t=1749567164\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.webm?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.mp4?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/963c1b507f270c950bbf3bff5fad4ab4.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember those horror movies where you yelled at the protagonist to scream, run, and call the police? Well\u2026 Now it's your turn to be the protagonist. Test your endurance, your mind, and your feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/04dda24554acb7561e074639607eb949.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story through its endings\u2014why did the killer come for you? Why are you strapped to that chair? And why a saw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, a short story\u2014but just enough to keep you entertained for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.poster.avif?t=1749567164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.webm?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.mp4?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/09df55f1ddadd5560b6fd5f2b8d01214.webp?t=1749567164\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game that\u2019s also a clicker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique events as you fight to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished, carefully crafted graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not too many puzzles, but just the right amount.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.poster.avif?t=1749567164\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.webm?t=1749567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f